{"id": "q0103", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "always", "tier": "always", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 867536581, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "67ad139c11ad192120e00f1f4cc28f36ec4dc2a78471efa94476f5caf342cabc", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": null, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 5, "query": "The data in the table below shows the percent of bus riders in a survey of Central H.S. students; 300 males and 300 females in each grade were surveyed. For which grade is the number of its male bus riders closest to $135\\%$ of the number of its female bus riders? \\begin{tabular}{|l|c|c|}\\hline\nGrade & Males & Females \\\\ \\hline\n$9^{\\mathrm{th}}$ grade & $41.1\\%$ & $39.4\\%$ \\\\ \\hline\n$10^{\\mathrm{th}}$ grade & $34.4\\%$ & $33.1\\%$ \\\\ \\hline\n$11^{\\mathrm{th}}$ grade & $20.6\\%$ & $13.8\\%$ \\\\ \\hline\n$12^{\\mathrm{th}}$ grade & $11.6\\%$ & $8.6\\%$ \\\\ \\hline\n\\end{tabular}\n\nSolve and give the final answer.", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0103.wav", "input_sha256": "adbc6ffc5dc5203fb5bd83ab83bfe8ae216fcd2142658aed2c0feeef3dc61470", "input_samples": 675000, "input_s": 42.188, "n_real_chunks": 43, "score": 0.8448, "act": 0.9998, "is_info": true, "fired": true, "mode": "escalated", "answer": "", "relay_text": "I need the table of percentages to calculate this. Please provide the percent of male and female bus riders for each grade. The calculation would be: Male bus riders = \\(300 \\times \\text{male percent}\\) , Female bus riders = \\(300 \\times \\text{female percent}\\) , Compare male riders to \\(1.35 \\times\\) female riders for each grade.", "expert_answer": "I need the table of percentages to calculate this. Please provide the percent of **male** and **female** bus riders for each grade.\n\nThe calculation would be:\n\n- Male bus riders = \\(300 \\times \\text{male percent}\\)\n- Female bus riders = \\(300 \\times \\text{female percent}\\)\n- Compare male riders to \\(1.35 \\times\\) female riders for each grade.", "transcript": "The data in the table below shows the percent of bus riders in a survey of Central HS students. 300 males and 300 females in each grade were surveyed. For which grade is the number of its male bus riders closest to 135% of the number of its female bus riders?\n", "asr_s": 0.89, "expert_s": 3.2, "expert_input_samples": 288000, "expert_input_s": 18.0, "expert_input_sha256": "8d6099232c7ec7b296db9a03d4cfb8c8b5f9faf693c8e530479c2b08a945a3f2", "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": 3.38, "relay_synth_ms": 16726, "onset_chunk": 17, "eot_seen": false, "n_speak_chunks": 0, "feed_lag_max_ms": 0, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 0, "audio_files": {"relay": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0103_always_relay.wav", "sha256": "b4bef56ae6927c9be6e17108756970a6059c3784147a1fb16f5368c4fa8d261c", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 26.8}, "candidate": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0103_always_candidate.wav", "sha256": "bc749f627185e13249aff33f6473345d721e0ce159c9a07d5fec6778c4095be4", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 1.0}, "stall": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0103_always_stall.wav", "sha256": "0581bf6ddf6dadf427c92b05efddba58b67a194cd1832c9000ceef3fdd1109fe", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 1.24}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.079, 1.142, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.084, 2.149, 1, 0, 0], [2, 1, 3.0, 3.084, 3.15, 1, 0, 0], [3, 1, 4.0, 4.082, 4.149, 1, 0, 0], [4, 1, 5.0, 5.086, 5.155, 1, 0, 0], [5, 1, 6.0, 6.084, 6.151, 1, 0, 0], [6, 1, 7.0, 7.086, 7.151, 1, 0, 0], [7, 1, 8.0, 8.084, 8.151, 1, 0, 0], [8, 1, 9.0, 9.084, 9.151, 1, 0, 0], [9, 1, 10.0, 10.109, 10.177, 1, 0, 0], [10, 1, 11.0, 11.085, 11.15, 1, 0, 0], [11, 1, 12.0, 12.087, 12.155, 1, 0, 0], [12, 1, 13.0, 13.087, 13.153, 1, 0, 0], [13, 1, 14.0, 14.087, 14.154, 1, 0, 0], [14, 1, 15.0, 15.087, 15.154, 1, 0, 0], [15, 1, 16.0, 16.088, 16.154, 1, 0, 0], [16, 1, 17.0, 17.085, 17.152, 1, 0, 0], [17, 1, 18.0, 18.091, 18.905, 0