{"id": "q0530", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "always", "tier": "always", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 2258117728, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "67ad139c11ad192120e00f1f4cc28f36ec4dc2a78471efa94476f5caf342cabc", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": null, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 5, "query": "描述数据存储的各种方法。", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0530.wav", "input_sha256": "d3c9a18d8228694bfb13f92c0a870308de19457a769f2b28f54544da1257bed9", "input_samples": 37400, "input_s": 2.337, "n_real_chunks": 3, "score": 0.294, "act": 0.9974, "is_info": true, "fired": true, "mode": "escalated", "answer": "", "relay_text": "数据存储的方法有很多，常见可按介质、组织方式、架构模式和应用场景来描述： , 文件存储 , 将数据以文件形式保存在磁盘、SSD、U盘、网络文件系统中。 , 常见格式：TXT、CSV、JSON、XML、Excel、日志文件等。 , 优点：简单、易读写；缺点：查询、并发和一致性能力较弱。 , 关系型数据库存储 , 使用表、行、列组织数据，通过 SQL 查询。 , 典型系统：MySQL、PostgreSQL、Oracle、SQL Server。 , 适合结构化数据、事务处理、财务系统、订单系统等。 , 非关系型数据库存储 , 又称 NoSQL，适合大规模、灵活结构或高并发场景。 , 常见类型包括： , 键值存储：如 Redis、DynamoDB。 , 文档存储：如 MongoDB、CouchDB。 , 列族存储：如 Cassandra、HBase。 , 图数据库：如.", "expert_answer": "数据存储的方法有很多，常见可按**介质、组织方式、架构模式和应用场景**来描述：\n\n1. **文件存储**\n   - 将数据以文件形式保存在磁盘、SSD、U盘、网络文件系统中。\n   - 常见格式：TXT、CSV、JSON、XML、Excel、日志文件等。\n   - 优点：简单、易读写；缺点：查询、并发和一致性能力较弱。\n\n2. **关系型数据库存储**\n   - 使用表、行、列组织数据，通过 SQL 查询。\n   - 典型系统：MySQL、PostgreSQL、Oracle、SQL Server。\n   - 适合结构化数据、事务处理、财务系统、订单系统等。\n\n3. **非关系型数据库存储**\n   - 又称 NoSQL，适合大规模、灵活结构或高并发场景。\n   - 常见类型包括：\n     - **键值存储**：如 Redis、DynamoDB。\n     - **文档存储**：如 MongoDB、CouchDB。\n     - **列族存储**：如 Cassandra、HBase。\n     - **图数据库**：如 Neo4j、JanusGraph。\n   - 优点：扩展性强、结构灵活；缺点：事务和复杂查询能力通常不如关系型数据库。\n\n4. **内存存储**\n   - 数据主要存放在内存中，读写速度很快。\n   - 典型系统：Redis、Memcached。\n   - 常用于缓存、会话管理、排行榜、实时计算等。\n   - 缺点是成本较高，断电可能丢失数据，通常需要持久化机制配合。\n\n5. **对象存储**\n   - 将数据作为对象保存，每个对象包含数据、元数据和唯一标识。\n   - 典型系统：Amazon S3、Azure Blob Storage、MinIO。\n   - 适合图片、视频、备份、日志、数据湖等海量非结构化数据。\n\n6. **块存储**\n   - 将数据分成固定大小的数据块存储，常用于云硬盘、虚拟机磁盘、数据库底层存储。\n   - 优点：性能较高、适合低延迟随机读写；缺点：管理复杂度相对较高。\n\n7. **分布式存储**\n   - 数据分布在多台服务器上，通过复制、分片等方式提高容量、性能和可靠性。\n   - 典型系统：HDFS、Ceph、GlusterFS。\n   - 适合大数据、云计算和高可用系统。\n\n8. **数据仓库存储**\n   - 面向分析而设计，通常保存经过清洗、整合的历史数据。\n   - 典型系统：Snowflake、BigQuery、Redshift、Hive。\n   - 适合报表分析、商业智能和决策支持。\n\n9. **数据湖存储**\n   - 存储原始数据，可以包括结构化、半结构化和非结构化数据。\n   - 常与对象存储、大数据处理框架结合使用。\n   - 适合机器学习、日志分析、海量数据探索。\n\n10. **备份与归档存储**\n   - 用于长期保存数据，防止数据丢失。\n   - 介质可以是磁带、冷存储、云归档服务等。\n   - 特点是成本低、访问速度较慢，适合合规、审计和灾难恢复。\n\n11. **本地存储与云存储**\n   - **本地存储**：数据保存在企业或个人自己的设备上，控制力强。\n   - **云存储**：数据保存在云服务商平台上，扩展方便、维护成本低。\n   - 实际系统中常采用混合云或多云存储方案。\n\n12. **临时存储与持久化存储**\n   - **临时存储**：数据只在程序运行期间存在，如缓存、临时文件。\n   - **持久化存储**：数据长期保存，如数据库、文件系统、对象存储。\n\n总的来说，数据存储方法的选择取决于**数据类型、访问速度、容量需求、成本、安全性、可靠性、查询方式和扩展能力**等因素。", "transcript": "描述数据存储的各种方法。\n", "asr_s": 0.48, "expert_s": 12.08, "expert_input_samples": 37400, "expert_input_s": 2.337, "expert_input_sha256": "d3c9a18d8228694bfb13f92c0a870308de19457a769f2b28f54544da1257bed9", "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": 11.518, "relay_synth_ms": 92061, "onset_chunk": 3, "eot_seen": false, "n_speak_chunks": 1, "feed_lag_max_ms": 272, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 272, "audio_files": {"relay": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0530_always_relay.wav", "sha256": "2d797d944a3bdac1af969980b75470c55a680e80f0d08109ee1b42116cb3b406", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 170.28}, "candidate": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0530_always_candidate.wav", "sha256": "996197c2216c14035e7b0e988f71e2ef31508bfc8336353790cfc6b075ead94d", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 1.0}, "stall": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0530_always_stall.wav", "sha256": "b1eed73c406d69ea11ba6cd3d8bf450a1f5528fe006b264ecbec085a30ef0972", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 1.52}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.071, 1.129, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.074, 2.13, 1, 0, 0], [2, 1, 2.337, 2.409, 2.464, 1, 0, 0], [3, 0, 3.337, 3.408, 4.001, 0, 24000, 0], [4, 0, 4.338, 4.681, 5.044, 0, 12480, 1]], "status": "completed", "error": null, "ts": {"feed_start": 0.0, "input_end": 2.337, "last_real_feed_done": 2.409, "onset": 4.001, "gate_read_done": 4.001, "fire": 4.001, "candidate_first_pcm": 4.001, "stall_note": 4.002, "stall_first_pcm": 4.61, "local_first_pcm": null, "wait_start": 5.044, "expert_req": 4.002, "expert_resp": 16.561, "relay_synth_start": 16.562, "relay_first_pcm": 17.4, "relay_synth_end": 108.624, "first_any_pcm": 4.001, "first_answer_pcm": 17.4, "session_end": 110.041}, "ttfa_answer_s": 15.062, "ttfa_any_s": 1.663}
{"id": "q0551", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "always", "tier": "always", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 2814751600, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "67ad139c11ad192120e00f1f4cc28f36ec4dc2a78471efa94476f5caf342cabc", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": null, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 5, "query": "Who are the parents of Eleanor Manning O'Connor?", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0551.wav", "input_sha256": "648414bff2fd3979ece00ef82c9f9006a6757810d35474ea3f4b931bcb1893aa", "input_samples": 46800, "input_s": 2.925, "n_real_chunks": 3, "score": 0.8467, "act": 0.9993, "is_info": true, "fired": true, "mode": "escalated", "answer": "", "relay_text": "Eleanor Manning O’Connor’s parents were Delia Josephine Grady and James Manning. Her father, James Manning, was a building contractor in Lynn, Massachusetts. (en.wikipedia.org)", "expert_answer": "Eleanor Manning O’Connor’s parents were **Delia Josephine Grady** and **James Manning**. Her father, James Manning, was a building contractor in Lynn, Massachusetts. ([en.wikipedia.org](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eleanor_Manning_O%27Connor?utm_source=openai))", "transcript": "Who are the parents of Eleanor Manning O'Connor?\n", "asr_s": 0.64, "expert_s": 5.36, "expert_input_samples": 46800, "expert_input_s": 2.925, "expert_input_sha256": "648414bff2fd3979ece00ef82c9f9006a6757810d35474ea3f4b931bcb1893aa", "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": 5.242, "relay_synth_ms": 9577, "onset_chunk": 3, "eot_seen": false, "n_speak_chunks": 0, "feed_lag_max_ms": 0, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 0, "audio_files": {"relay": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0551_always_relay.wav", "sha256": "bbb9134c31ba9c056c5d335ba4a5436288898465525028b4e87ce68672f26dbd", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 15.2}, "candidate": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0551_always_candidate.wav", "sha256": "73426345d094888f41338d9db23cf6972fd58998f2